  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Updated the Cpak package to Bottles 67.4 with Soda 11.0-10.\n* Fixed Battle.net crashes and KiriKiri first-run video playback in Soda.\n* Updated the immutable Components catalog fallback.\n\nBottles 67.3 on Flathub receives Soda 11.0-10 through the Components catalog and does not require an application update.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/bottlesdevs/Bottles/compare/67.3...67.4\n\n<!-- install-badges -->\n\n## Get Bottles\n\n[![Download on Flathub](https://flathub.org/api/badge?svg&locale=en)](https://flathub.org/apps/com.usebottles.bottles)\n[![Get it with cpak](https://cpak.it/badges/get-it-with-cpak.svg)](https://cpak.it/store/Utilities/github.com/bottlesdevs/bottles)",
